# === Repo structure: 3 folders at root ===
# submission/  -> MIDC source (paper + code + results), git-tracked, submit-ready
# companion/   -> MIBE companion-paper data, gitignored (under review separately)
# meta/        -> working docs, refs, human-eval tarballs, external repos, gitignored

# --- companion/: MIBE data, not part of MIDC submission ---
companion/

# --- meta: working material, not part of MIDC submission ---
meta/

# --- within submission/: caches, generated outputs, human-eval artifacts ---
